  `AsmReloc.{laHi,laLo,jalOff}`, so a `.text`/`.data` size change only
  requires regenerating the TSV + this file, never the 100s of `_prog`s.
  Guarded by `scripts/check-asm-to-program.sh` (regenerate + diff).

